---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { formula, formulaAgent, formulaDetail } from '../config';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---

<BaseLayout title="How it works" description="Escalane = Decide + Act — state to gated catalog action.">
	<section class="page">
		<h1>How it works</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			Industry ships <code>{formulaAgent}</code> (model invents calls). Escalane ships
			<code>{formula}</code> — expanded <code>{formulaDetail}</code>. Same loop energy; closed action set.
			Multi-turn stays on an authored rail: decide → act → observe → decide again.
		</p>

		<ol class="steps">
			<li>
				<strong>State</strong>
				<span>Alerts, metrics, locks, inventory — evidence only. No command authority fields.</span>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Decide</strong>
				<span>System One (<code>choice</code> ∪ escalate, <code>noul</code>, blast) over catalog criteria.</span>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Bind + precheck</strong>
				<span>Params from inventory/labels; locks and cooldowns checked before act.</span>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Gate</strong>
				<span>Ordered A0–A3 vetoes. First failure wins (deny / hitl / escalate).</span>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Act</strong>
				<span>Render argv from catalog templates (systemd, Docker CLI, Databricks CLI, scripts). Dry-run default.</span>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Audit</strong>
				<span>Episode JSONL with catalog hash, answers, gate steps, bound params, argv digests.</span>
			</li>
		</ol>

		<pre class="flow" aria-label="Flow diagram">{`caller → harness
  → System One decide
  → bind_params + prechecks
  → gates A0–A3
  → executor (template argv)
  → verify + episode audit`}</pre>

		<p class="more">
			<a href={`${base}docs/gates/`}>Gate details</a>
			·
			<a href={`${base}docs/quick-start/`}>Quick start</a>
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.page {
		max-width: var(--max);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 1.25rem 3rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		animation: rise 0.6s var(--ease) both;
	}

	.lede {
		max-width: 42rem;
		color: var(--ink-muted);
		margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
	}

	.lede code {
		font-size: 0.9em;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.steps {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.1rem;
		counter-reset: step;
	}

	.steps li {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 1rem 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
		counter-increment: step;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.steps li::before {
		content: counter(step, decimal-leading-zero);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--accent-dim);
		grid-column: 1 / -1;
	}

	.steps strong {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.steps span {
		color: var(--ink-muted);
	}

	.steps code {
		font-size: 0.88em;
		color: var(--accent-dim);
	}

	.flow {
		background: var(--bg-elev);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		padding: 1.25rem 1.35rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--ink-muted);
		overflow-x: auto;
		border-radius: 2px;
	}

	.more {
		margin-top: 1.75rem;
		color: var(--ink-muted);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.steps li {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
